# An error occured. This is because Omnis failed to call the worker, or the worker returned a SendError response
# Examples of each error:
# Failed to call the worker: Image data was too large, using a smaller image resolved this issue (if this becomes an issue in production consider storing the images in an intermediate location)
# SendError response: Image provided to Java was blank, such as when an initial image hasn't been loaded. This could be fixed with validation in oImageHandler before calling the worker.

Breakpoint [pError]